@brad070390 is an experienced gym-goer with a military background, having trained at a high level for many years. But he wanted some help with diet and nutrition so came to @acdc_fitness for some guidance. 

He didn’t need help with training as he already had that sorted and it continued to be progressive and structured working alongside @mbennett666 but  he then also applied that same military mindset to his diet with Andy’s help, completely locked in and stayed consistent. The result- An incredible 22kg lost in just under 5 months! 🔥

